          "text": "The ORCID iD mark: a green roundel carrying a white lowercase `iD`, set immediately after the author's name in the byline. It is publisher furniture rather than content of the paper \u2014 it carries no argument, datum or figure \u2014 and in the source PDF it is the only embedded raster on any of the six pages.",
